  "summary": "Kelly and Ryan announce they secretly married a week prior and are now getting divorced. While returning from a sales call, Jim accidentally strands Michael at a gas station without his phone or money due to an emergency with baby Cece. Dwight, Erin, and Holly set out across Scranton to locate Michael. Meanwhile, Pam starts a caption contest at the office that Gabe attempts to control, leading the coworkers to submit jokes mocking Gabe. Holly follows her instincts to a rooftop where she finds Michael, and the two share a kiss."
